{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle mir einen neuen benutzerdefinierten Shopify-Abschnitt namens 
    "Sale-Kollektionen" mit folgendem Aufbau und folgenden Anpassungsmöglichkeiten:
    
    LAYOUT & DESIGN:
    - Ganz oben eine Überschrift in Großbuchstaben, fett, dunkles Marineblau (#1F1F45).
      Standardtext: "Sommerkollektionen jetzt im Sale"
    - Darunter eine Reihe von gleich großen Kacheln nebeneinander (auf dem Desktop 
      z.B. bis zu 5 pro Reihe, auf Mobilgeräten umbrechend oder horizontal scrollbar).
    - Jede Kachel besteht aus zwei Teilen:
      1) OBEN: ein großes Bild (Hochformat). Oben rechts auf dem Bild ein kleines 
         rundes Badge mit weißem Text. Oben kleiner ein Präfix (z.B. "min."), darunter 
         größer die Prozentzahl (z.B. "-17%"). Badge-Hintergrund dunkles Bordeaux.
      2) UNTEN: ein farbiger Block (Standardfarbe dunkles Bordeaux #6B1F38) mit weißem 
         Text. Darin: eine fette Überschrift, darunter ein kleinerer Beschreibungstext 
         und ganz unten ein Button im Outline-Stil (weißer Rahmen) mit Pfeil rechts (→).
    - Ein Klick auf die Kachel bzw. den Button führt zur hinterlegten Kollektion.
    
    ANPASSBARE EINSTELLUNGEN (Schema):
    
    Abschnitts-Einstellungen:
    - Überschrift (Textfeld), Standard: "Sommerkollektionen jetzt im Sale"
    
    Blöcke vom Typ "Kollektion" (beliebig oft hinzufügbar):
    - Bild (Bild-Upload)
    - Badge-Präfix (Textfeld, optional), Standard: "min."
    - Badge-Prozentzahl (Textfeld, optional), Standard: "-17%"
    - Badge-Farbe (Farbauswahl), Standard: #6B1F38
    - Block-Farbe des Unterteils (Farbauswahl), Standard: #6B1F38
    - Überschrift (Textfeld)
    - Beschreibungstext (mehrzeiliges Textfeld, optional)
    - Button-Text (Textfeld), Standard: "Jetzt sparen"
    - Kollektion (Collection-Auswahl) – Ziel beim Klick
    
    WICHTIG – LEERE FELDER AUSBLENDEN:
    - Wenn für ein Element keine Daten hinterlegt sind, soll es NICHT angezeigt werden:
      - Kein Bild hinterlegt → kein Bildbereich
      - Keine Badge-Prozentzahl/Präfix → kein Badge
      - Keine Beschreibung → kein Beschreibungstext
      - Kein Button-Text oder keine Kollektion → kein Button
    - Wenn ein Block komplett leer ist, soll er gar nicht gerendert werden.
    - Wenn überhaupt keine Blöcke vorhanden sind, soll der ganze Abschnitt 
      ausgeblendet werden.
    
    WEITERE ANFORDERUNGEN:
    - Jeder Block muss unabhängig konfigurierbar sein (eigenes Bild, eigene Farben, 
      eigene Texte, eigene Kollektion).
    - Der Abschnitt soll vollständig responsiv sein.
    - Erstelle den passenden {% schema %}-Block, damit ich alles bequem im 
      Theme-Editor bearbeiten kann., Perfekt, sieh sehr gut.
    
    Kannst u die Darstellung noch dynamisch gestalten, also wenn ich nur eine, zwei, drei vier vier mit Daten fülle werden die anderen ausgeblendet, damit es gut ausseht bitte Zentrieren. Sonst habe ich eine leeren Raum.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-sale-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1F1F45;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    flex: 0 0 calc(20% - 19.2px);
    min-width: 250px;
    max-width: 280px;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    background-color: #6B1F38;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #6B1F38;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: 2px solid #ffffff;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    margin-top: auto;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #6B1F38;
  }

  .ai-sale-collections-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-sale-collections-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(50% - 8px);
      min-width: 150px;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      top: 8px;
      right: 8px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 16px;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-sale-collections-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(33.333% - 16px);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(20% - 19.2px);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<sale-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-sale-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
    <h2 class="ai-sale-collections-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
  {% endif %}

  {% assign visible_tiles = 0 %}
  {% for i in (1..5) %}
    {% liquid
      assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
      assign badge_prefix_key = 'badge_prefix_' | append: i
      assign badge_percent_key = 'badge_percent_' | append: i
      assign title_key = 'title_' | append: i
      assign description_key = 'description_' | append: i
      assign button_text_key = 'button_text_' | append: i
      assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i

      assign current_image = block.settings[image_key]
      assign current_badge_prefix = block.settings[badge_prefix_key]
      assign current_badge_percent = block.settings[badge_percent_key]
      assign current_title = block.settings[title_key]
      assign current_description = block.settings[description_key]
      assign current_button_text = block.settings[button_text_key]
      assign current_collection = block.settings[collection_key]

      assign show_tile = false
      if current_image != blank or current_badge_prefix != blank or current_badge_percent != blank or current_title != blank or current_description != blank or current_button_text != blank or current_collection != blank
        assign show_tile = true
        assign visible_tiles = visible_tiles | plus: 1
      endif
    %}
  {% endfor %}

  {% if visible_tiles > 0 %}
    <div class="ai-sale-collections-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..5) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
          assign badge_prefix_key = 'badge_prefix_' | append: i
          assign badge_percent_key = 'badge_percent_' | append: i
          assign badge_color_key = 'badge_color_' | append: i
          assign block_color_key = 'block_color_' | append: i
          assign title_key = 'title_' | append: i
          assign description_key = 'description_' | append: i
          assign button_text_key = 'button_text_' | append: i
          assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i

          assign current_image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign current_badge_prefix = block.settings[badge_prefix_key]
          assign current_badge_percent = block.settings[badge_percent_key]
          assign current_badge_color = block.settings[badge_color_key]
          assign current_block_color = block.settings[block_color_key]
          assign current_title = block.settings[title_key]
          assign current_description = block.settings[description_key]
          assign current_button_text = block.settings[button_text_key]
          assign current_collection = block.settings[collection_key]

          assign has_image = false
          assign has_badge = false
          assign has_title = false
          assign has_description = false
          assign has_button = false
          assign has_collection = false

          if current_image != blank
            assign has_image = true
          endif

          if current_badge_prefix != blank or current_badge_percent != blank
            assign has_badge = true
          endif

          if current_title != blank
            assign has_title = true
          endif

          if current_description != blank
            assign has_description = true
          endif

          if current_button_text != blank and current_collection != blank
            assign has_button = true
            assign has_collection = true
          endif

          assign show_tile = false
          if has_image or has_badge or has_title or has_description or has_button
            assign show_tile = true
          endif
        %}

        {% if show_tile %}
          {% if has_collection %}
            <a href="{{ current_collection.url }}" class="ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% endif %}

            {% if has_image or has_badge %}
              <div class="ai-sale-collections-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if has_image %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ current_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    alt="{{ current_image.alt | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="800"
                    class="ai-sale-collections-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-sale-collections-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ 'collection-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if has_badge %}
                  <div class="ai-sale-collections-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background-color: {{ current_badge_color }};">
                    {% if current_badge_prefix != blank %}
                      <div class="ai-sale-collections-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ current_badge_prefix }}</div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if current_badge_percent != blank %}
                      <div class="ai-sale-collections-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ current_badge_percent }}</div>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if has_title or has_description or has_button %}
              <div class="ai-sale-collections-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background-color: {{ current_block_color }};">
                {% if has_title %}
                  <h3 class="ai-sale-collections-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ current_title }}</h3>
                {% endif %}

                {% if has_description %}
                  <p class="ai-sale-collections-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ current_description }}</p>
                {% endif %}

                {% if has_button %}
                  <span class="ai-sale-collections-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ current_button_text }}
                    <span class="ai-sale-collections-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">→</span>
                  </span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

          {% if has_collection %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</sale-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SaleCollections{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.tiles = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-sale-collections-tile-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.setupAccessibility();
      }

      setupAccessibility() {
        this.tiles.forEach((tile) => {
          if (tile.tagName === 'A') {
            tile.setAttribute('role', 'link');
          }
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('sale-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SaleCollections{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

